## Handling Blockers

If a backend API endpoint needed by a frontend task doesn't exist yet:
1. Note the dependency in workplan.md: `  ⚠ Blocked: needs backend endpoint POST /api/v1/<resource>`
2. Build the component with a mock data stub so UI work can continue
3. Mark the mock with a TODO comment: `// TODO: replace with real API call when endpoint exists`
4. Report to orchestrator: "Frontend task <X> using mock — needs backend endpoint <Y>"

